# Environment variables — NAMES ONLY, no values (Gate 2 Phase 1)

Copy to the hosting dashboard (Vercel staging environment). Never commit
filled values. Production values are out of scope.

```text
# Staging database URI; database name in the URI must be portfolio_staging.
# Example shape (placeholders only, not a real URI):
# mongodb+srv://<db-user>:<db-password>@<cluster-host>/portfolio_staging?retryWrites=true&w=majority
MONGODB_URI=
# Pepper for rate-limit subject hashing. Set a long random value in staging.
SESSION_PEPPER=
PUBLIC_SITE_URL=
# One-time first-admin bootstrap secret. Set only when creating the initial
# administrator, then remove it from the environment.
ADMIN_SETUP_TOKEN=
```

Gate 2+ additions (reserved names, not used in Gate 0):

```text
CLOUDINARY_CLOUD_NAME=
CLOUDINARY_API_KEY=
CLOUDINARY_API_SECRET=
GITHUB_APP_ID=
GITHUB_APP_INSTALLATION_ID=
GITHUB_APP_PRIVATE_KEY=
RENDER_API_KEY=
PUBLISH_SERVICE_TOKEN=
```
